flowchart LR
    Human[Human employee / admin / reviewer] --> PWA[Phone or Browser PWA]
    PWA --> Gateway[Self-hosted DMZ/VPN Gateway]
    Gateway --> Cockpit[Remote Execution Cockpit]
    Cockpit --> GUI[Guacamole / MeshCentral / RustDesk / KasmVNC]
    Cockpit --> Terminal[xterm.js + tmux]
    Cockpit --> Board[Agentic Work Board]
    Board --> Agent[Agentic Desktop / Agent Runner]
    Agent --> Model[Frontier BYOK / Internal model / Local model]
    Agent --> Tools[Files / Terminal / Browser / IDE / Apps]
    Board --> Evidence[Evidence Packet]
    Evidence --> Review[Human Review]
